## 2. Precision Loss

### Division Before Multiplication

```solidity
// VULNERABLE - loses precision
function calculateReward(uint256 amount, uint256 rate, uint256 time) 
    public pure returns (uint256) 
{
    return (amount / 1000) * rate * time;  // Division first loses decimals
}

// SECURE - multiply first
function calculateReward(uint256 amount, uint256 rate, uint256 time) 
    public pure returns (uint256) 
{
    return (amount * rate * time) / 1000;  // Division last preserves precision
}
```

### Decimal Handling

```solidity
// Common pattern with 18 decimals
uint256 constant PRECISION = 1e18;

function calculateShares(uint256 assets, uint256 totalShares, uint256 totalAssets) 
    public pure returns (uint256) 
{
    if (totalAssets == 0) return assets;
    return (assets * totalShares) / totalAssets;  // May lose dust
}
```

